        "Content": "Take a Virtual Tour here:\r\nhttps://view.ricoh360.com/f5e3deb1-6b92-4f73-9ed0-0b7a83d9f2fa\r\n\r\n5 Millgate Drive, Manor Estate, Perrystown, Dublin 12 \r\n\r\nAsking Price: €750,000 | 3 Bed | 2 Bath | Semi-Detached with Self-Contained Granny Flat | BER: C Description \r\n\r\nKeller Williams Ireland is delighted to present No. 5 Millgate Drive to the market. This highly impressive, modernised semi-detached family home offers an extraordinary amount of space and versatility, featuring a substantial double-storey rear extension and a self-contained granny flat to the side. Presented with an excellent BER C energy rating, the property effortlessly accommodates modern family living. \r\n\r\nThe thoughtful layout provides independence for multi-generational living, a lucrative rental potential, or a generous home business setup, all while keeping a warm, interconnected family feel. Situated in the highly sought-after and mature residential setting of Manor Estate, this property is the ultimate forever home. \r\n\r\nAccommodation \r\nMain House — Ground Floor Entrance Hall: A grand and welcoming hallway boasting beautiful original parquet flooring and clever under-stairs storage. Living Room: A bright, comfortable reception room anchored by a traditional open fireplace—ideal for cosy winter evenings. \r\nKitchen & TV Family Area: Part of the expansive rear extension, this large kitchen features an adjoining TV family lounge complete with its own open fireplace, creating a vibrant and welcoming heart to the home. \r\nMain House — First Floor Master Bedroom (Extended): A magnificent, larger-than-average double bedroom benefiting from the rear extension, featuring extensive built-in wardrobes. \r\nBedroom 2 (Extended): Another substantial, extended double bedroom comfortably finished with carpets and fitted built-in wardrobes. \r\nBedroom 3: A well-proportioned double bedroom featuring a charming original open fireplace. \r\nFamily Bathroom: Fully tiled on both floors and walls, modernised with a sleek chrome towel radiator. \r\nAttic: Partially converted/floored, offering excellent additional storage potential. \r\nSelf-Contained Granny Flat (Side Annex) Accessed via separate external access or through convenient connecting doors from the main house: Includes a fully equipped kitchenette, a separate bathroom with walk-in shower, and a bright double bedroom. Features double doors leading directly out to the rear garden, offering independent outdoor access and lovely natural light. \r\n\r\nLocation & Amenities \r\nMillgate Drive is perfectly positioned in a quiet, mature neighborhood between Terenure, Templeogue, and Walkinstown. \r\n\r\nEducation: \r\nWithin the catchment area for highly regarded primary and secondary schools, including Our Lady's School, Terenure College, and St Pius X. Transport & \r\n\r\nConvenience: \r\nSeamless commute links to Dublin City Centre via multiple bus routes, with easy access to the M50 network. Excellent shopping options are nearby at the Ashleaf Shopping Centre as well as the bustling villages of Terenure and Templeogue. \r\n\r\nKey Features \r\nSubstantial 3-bedroom semi-detached home with a double-storey rear extension. \r\nSelf-contained granny flat/annex to the side with independent garden access. \r\nExcellent energy-efficient BER C rating. \r\nStunning original parquet flooring in the entrance hallway. \r\nThree feature open fireplaces across the main living spaces. \r\nExtended master and second bedrooms with extensive built-in storage. \r\nFully tiled family bathroom with an integrated towel radiator. \r\nHighly desirable location close to top schools, villages, and parklands. \r\n\r\nProperty Facilities \r\nOff-Street Parking \r\nGas Fired Central Heating (GFCH) \r\nThree Open Fireplaces \r\nDouble-Storey Extension \r\nSelf-Contained Annex / Granny Flat \r\nPartially Converted Attic Storage"
      },
